metadata/design_notes = "A stand-up: eight posts in a ring around the reward, with the enemies standing outside it. The ring is cover with holes in it: a post blocks one line and leaves the next one open, so the middle is never safe and never fully exposed. Difficulty 3 because the ring draws the player to the middle, where the enemies can reach them through the gaps from every side."
